  "body_html": "<p>No, it’s not Barry Manilow. Here we’re talking about something way more badass – UK post-punk rockers create a raw and energetic garage sound with a distinctively British taste that reminds me of bands like Agent Orange, Wire, Television and The Sex Pistols.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone\" height=\"960\" src=\"https://scontent-a-lga.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-xap1/v/t1.0-9/1560652_581596465254983_35898921_n.jpg?oh=cfeb9cd2fa43999f2503b28933a586a4&amp;oe=54D72AEF\" width=\"720\"/></p>\n<p>The opening track “Missing” is as nihilistic and punk as it gets. The second track “Law Here” features sludgy guitars and languid vocals. I really like “Control Issue” with its high energy and oldschool vibe, which is the total opposite of the more laid back closing “Vitamins” with its long groovy guitar riffs.</p>\n<p><iframe frameborder=\"no\" height=\"450\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/playlists/51363559&amp;auto_play=false&amp;hide_related=false&amp;show_comments=true&amp;show_user=true&amp;show_reposts=false&amp;visual=true\" width=\"100%\"></iframe></p>\n<p>Overall “Cease and Desist” is raw and even if it doesn’t really create something new, this debut EP possesses some of the best sides of the good old punk-rock. And what else do we need.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone\" height=\"732\" src=\"https://fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-xpa1/v/t1.0-9/10410846_713162485431713_7251895747230018611_n.jpg?oh=69145be049e2fa69eb2561c96fb99d7c&amp;oe=54ED29CC&amp;__gda__=1424704628_233658ef4fa135bc35ad276470a52163\" width=\"732\"/></p>\n<p>Manilow are Dean Moston, Paul Chamberlain and Gary Cardno. More about them on<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Manilow.band\"> Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/manilow-band/\">Soundcloud</a> and <a href=\"https://manilow.bandcamp.com/\">Bandcamp</a>.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://scontent-a-lga.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-xaf1/v/t1.0-9/10257352_641042522643710_4638552595167755673_n.jpg?oh=ec916080d964697320b08377ec8704f2&amp;oe=551B8BF7\" width=\"480\"/></p>",
